      "readme": "# Natural Dialogue fMRI Dataset\nfMRI data was recorded while participants had dialogue tasks involving chatting about specific topics, such as self-introduction and favorite classes. Each participant was scanned for about 27 runs over the course of three to four sessions. \n\n### Derivatives\n1. proprocessed data: preprocessed fMRI data, features used for voxel-wise modeling, GPT embeddings, morpheme and syllable rates.\n2. fsROI: FreeSurfer regions of interest\n3. pycortex_db: Cortical maps used by Pycortex\n4. results: sample results for visualization by Pycortex",
